1138..1212 Comment "/// The state-passing model answers the scope in place of written clauses:"
1213..1286 Comment "/// each operation is the model\'s, so the subject computes a value of its"
1287..1362 Comment "/// carrier, a function of the initial state. Storing four and then reading"
1363..1439 Comment "/// twice, both reads see four, as `putThenGet` calls the model\'s operations"
1440..1452 Comment "/// by hand."
